# Feature engineering

For eligible sensors, consider:

```text
current value
lag 1/2/5/10/25/50
rolling mean/std/min/max/range
rolling slope
EWMA
first difference
delta from engine baseline
relative delta from baseline
```

Candidate rolling windows: `5, 10, 25, 50, 100`.

If snapshots represent stable operating conditions:
- preserve snapshot-specific values,
- pivot sensors by snapshot,
- compute cross-snapshot deltas,
- compute phase-specific trends.

If point-in-time valid, include:
- cycles since last WW,
- cycles since last HPC shop visit,
- cycles since last HPT shop visit,
- prior maintenance counts.

Fit PCA, health indices, scalers, and all learned transforms using training data only.
